OL,3,AStudent admits murdering woman in
OL,4,A'Dexter' kill room
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors said he had carefully
OL,7,Fplanned the killing of Maria Saceanu,
OL,8,Fpreparing a room with plastic sheeting
OL,9,Fand items intended to help him murder
OL,10,Fher and dispose of evidence.
